<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How about the hippos?</l><l>How about the lambs?</l><l>How about the dolphins?</l><l>How about the clams?</l><l>Could all of this just happen?</l><l>No, that could never be!</l><l>God Himself has made them,</l><l>For you and for me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
